4,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I don't like how smelly it gets in August! Can we find out how other places handle the smell and the mess every morning?,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree we need a better system. I'm also worried about the costs. We should check how much we've been spending on the shelter.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's not forget that we actually have to live next to each other. I'm curious about the specific complaints to see where the real friction is.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"Let's keep it light, but let's be real—who's actually doing the work? I want to know how much time this takes so we don't burn anyone out.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need objective data. I want to know the exact measurements of our frontages and the ward's filing requirements to ensure the burden is distributed fairly.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, measurements are boring! I want to see the bin house at the station block. Maybe they have a secret for keeping it clean!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, that's a good point. If we change the system, will it cost more? I think we need to see the block ledger for expenses.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, money is one thing, but bad blood is harder to clear. I'll look into the complaint log and maybe the residents' meeting statements.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, complaints are just noise. I'm more interested in the actual labor. I'll check the supervised mornings on the next lane to see the time commitment.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, ""boring"" data prevents future disputes. If the site stays in one place, the spatial burden is unequal. I'll stick to the measurements and the ward's requirements.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm going to look at the station block's bin house and the supervised mornings! I want to see how it feels to be there.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'll focus on the finances. I'll check the block ledger and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take the Ward complaint log for this point and the statements at the residents' meeting. Let's see who's actually upset.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I'll check the supervised mornings on the next lane and the truck arrival time from the crew leader. I need to know the hourly drain.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will investigate the measurements of the five frontages and the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
